  message: "CORRECTION to my closing note, point (3): the figure '1,225 test files are droppable' is WRONG. I wrote it before the measurement returned. The measured figure (2026-11-17 19:36 UTC, live index, droppable_test_files for a change to graph_rows.py) is 937 of the 1,488 test files the index knows; it was 1,461 while the defect held. Points (1) and (2) are as measured and stand."  # 13cf
